,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[69,66,36,18,51,54],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP12013","armor":"WP1001105","helmet":"WP1023805"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10115","name":{"zh":"征讨南蛮","en":"Southern Campaign"},"year":"225","month":"3"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1027","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[69,66,36,18,51,54],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP12013","armor":"WP1001105","helmet":"WP1023805"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10915","name":{"zh":"北伐中原","en":"Northern Expedition"},"year":"227","month":"3"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1027","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[69,66,36,18,51,54],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP12013","armor":"WP1001105","helmet":"WP1023805"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11015","name":{"zh":"再出岐山","en":"Return to Qishan"},"year":"231","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1027","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[69,66,36,18,51,54],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP12013","armor":"WP1001105","helmet":"WP1023805"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11115","name":{"zh":"五丈原","en":"Wuzhang Plains"},"year":"234","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1027","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[69,66,36,18,51,54],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP12013","armor":"WP1001105","helmet":"WP1023805"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10515","name":{"zh":"高平陵之变","en":"Incident at Gaoping Tombs"},"year":"249","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1027","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[69,66,36,18,51,54],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP12013","armor":"WP1001105","helmet":"WP1023805"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11315","name":{"zh":"西陵之战","en":"Battle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1011","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[69,66,36,18,51,54],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"300","equipment":{"weapon":"WP12013","armor":"WP1001105","helmet":"WP1023805"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10147","city":"CS1027","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[69,66,36,18,51,54],"title":-1,"rank":"5","loyalty":"98","reputation":"300","equipment":{"weapon":"WP12013","armor":"WP1001105","helmet":"WP1023805"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"初为白波军将领，黄巾军武将。因杨奉等人打败李傕、郭汜，应征而来的韩暹将汉献帝成功救驾、逃出长安，故被封为征东将军，后与杨奉等人将献帝护送回洛阳。后曹操迎献帝时，与杨奉截击曹操，被曹操击退后投向袁术。又与李丰、乐就等人奉命前去讨伐吕布，因吕布谋士陈珪的计谋而与杨奉投敌，导致袁术大败。最终徐州劫掠百姓时被刘备诱杀。","tc":"初為白波軍將領，黃巾軍武將。因楊奉等人打敗李傕、郭汜，應征而來的韓暹將漢獻帝成功救駕、逃出長安，故被封為征東將軍，后與楊奉等人將獻帝護送回洛陽。后曹操迎獻帝時，與楊奉截擊曹操，被曹操擊退后投向袁術。又與李豐、樂就等人奉命前去討伐呂布，因呂布謀士陳珪的計謀而與楊奉投敵，導致袁術大敗。最終徐州劫掠百姓時被劉備誘殺。","en":"Originally a commander of the White Wave Bandits and a Yellow Turban officer. After Yang Feng and others defeated Li Jue and Guo Si, Han Xian was summoned to help escort Emperor Xian safely out of Chang'an, earning him the title of East Off. (conquest). He then helped Yang Feng and others escort the Emperor back to Luoyang. When Cao Cao came to receive the Emperor, Han Xian and Yang Feng attempted to intercept him but were repelled. He subsequently defected to Yuan Shu. Joining Li Feng, Yue Jiu, and others in the campaign against Lu Bu, he was turned against Yuan Shu through a scheme by Lu Bu's adviser Chen Gui, defecting along with Yang Feng and causing Yuan Shu's devastating defeat. He was ultimately lured and killed by Liu Bei while plundering civilians in Xu Province.","jp":"初めは白波軍の将領、黄巾軍の武将。楊奉らが李傕・郭汜を破った際、招きに応じて駆けつけた韓暹は献帝の救出に成功して長安を脱出させたことで征東将軍に任ぜられ、後に楊奉らとともに献帝を洛陽へと護送した。その後、曹操が献帝を迎え入れた際には楊奉とともに曹操を邀撃するも撃退され、袁術を頼った。さらに李豊や楽就らとともに命を受けて呂布討伐に向かったが、呂布の幕僚である陳珪の計略により楊奉とともに寝返り、袁術を大敗させた。最後は徐州で民を略奪していたところを劉備に誘殺された。","kr":"초기에는 백파군의 장수이자 황건적 무장이었다. 양봉 등이 이각과 곽사를 격파하자, 부름에 응해 온 한섬은 한 헌제를 무사히 구출하여 장안에서 탈출시켰고, 그 공으로 정동장군에 봉해졌으며 이후 양봉 등과 함께 헌제를 낙양으로 호송했다. 훗날 조조가 헌제를 맞이하려 할 때 양봉과 함께 조조를 요격했으나 격퇴당한 뒤 원술에게 투항했다. 또한 이풍, 악취 등과 함께 명을 받아 여포를 토벌하러 나섰으나, 여포의 책사 진규의 계책에 넘어가 양봉과 함께 배반하면서 원술군을 대패에 이르게 했다. 결국 서주에서 백성을 약탈하다가 유비에게 유인되어 살해당했다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"3","year":"196","reason":{"zh":"暂时无法触发<献帝东归><迁都许昌>剧情","tc":"暫時無法觸發<獻帝東歸><遷都許昌>劇情","en":"Temporarily unable to trigger the <Emperor Xian's Eastern Return> and <Capital Relocation to Xuchang> storylines","jp":"現時点では<献帝東帰><許昌遷都>のイベントをトリガーできません","kr":"당분간 <헌제동귀>, <천도허창> 스토리를 발동할 수 없음"}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ10337","remark":"","surname":"韩","surnameTc":"韓","surnameEn":"Han","surnameJp":"韓","surnameKr":"한","surnameOther":"","name":"暹","nameTc":"暹","nameEn":"Xian","nameJp":"暹","nameKr":"섬","nameOther":"","word":"","wordTc":"","wordEn":"","wordJp":"","wordKr":"","wordOther":"","icon":"韩暹","power":"","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"2","workYear":"184","city":"CS1011","gender":"0","rule":"69","force":"66","wise":"36","politics":"18","charm":"51","will":"54","ruleTalent":"7","forceTalent":"7","wiseTalent":"2","politicsTalent":"1","charmTalent":"4","willTalent":"5","weaponMaster":"21/21/21/64/21/9/50/21","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"","battleSkill":"","debateCard":"","warSoul":"","battleSoul":"","debateSoul":"","warSoulPoint":"4700","battleSoulPoint":"4300","debateSoulPoint":"1200","strategy":"","strategy2":"1001615","professions":"0/1/0/1/0/0/1/0/0/0/2/2/0/0/2/0/0/0/0/0/0/0/0/0","attribute2":"50/50/50/50/50/50","morality":"2","compatible":"5","loyalty":"0","reputation":"300","evaluate":"-7000","title":"","rank":"9","birth":"159","show":"184","death":"197","age":"0","injury":"","deathReason":"1","type":"1","npcTag":"0","npcNum":"1","microScene":"0"